# School Virtual Library - French catalog (Work Package 7).
#
# This catalog is hand-maintained because the project's Windows dev image has
# no GNU gettext binaries (`msgfmt`/`xgettext` are absent). It is compiled to
# locale/fr/LC_MESSAGES/django.mo with Babel (dev dependency) - see
# tools/compile_messages.py. On a machine WITH GNU gettext, the standard
# workflow still applies: `makemessages` refreshes this file and
# `compilemessages` rebuilds django.mo.
#
# msgids must match Django's template `{% trans %}` / `{% blocktrans %}` and
# Python `gettext` source strings EXACTLY.
